  "title": "How to Tell if Bad Onboarding Is Causing Your Churn",
  "summary": "Your churn reasons are lying to you There is a number in your churn dashboard next to \"onboarding.\" It is probably close to zero. That number is wrong, and it's wrong in a predictable direction. This post is about how to find the real one. Not estimate it. Find it, in your own data, with a method you can defend in fron...",
